{"title":"The DOGE principle","link":"https://www.garbageday.email/p/the-doge-principle","date":1744394999000,"content":"<div><div><p><i>Welcome to Garbage Weekend. It’s the internet garbage you know and love, but in a format that’s easier to read while you suffer through the agony of fake spring.</i></p><div><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/0185faf0-825f-4724-9953-5dc9aad034f3/GettyImages-2208756323.jpg?t=1744377965\" /><div><span><p>(Photo by ANGELA WEISS/AFP via Getty Images)</p></span></div></div><p>This week, we got the most visible example yet of <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/02/25/upshot/doge-spending-cuts-changed.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">the DOGE principle</a>, or \"<a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/business/live-news/tariffs-trump-news-04-02-25/index.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">shut everything down</a> and <a href=\"https://www.cnn.com/2025/04/09/business/reciprocal-tariff-pause-trump/index.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">kinda restart</a> whatever people complain about.” What a trillion, wait, no, <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2025/04/10/us/politics/musk-doge-drops-goal.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">billion dollar idea</a>! Unfortunately for all the <a href=\"https://www.inc.com/joe-procopio/why-your-founder-mode-ceo-is-terrible.html?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">foundermoders</a>, it turns out there are some problems with doing that to all international trade with the US. Apparently, people don't want the<a href=\"https://www.marketwatch.com/livecoverage/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-nasdaq-to-dip-after-historic-rally-on-trump-tariff-turnround-cpi-on-tap/card/dollar-index-near-6-month-low-as-u-s-policy-uncertainty-lingers-QNos1wRMH2dVVaxcKYeJ?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\"> US dollar to be a meme stock</a>. They’d also rather <a href=\"https://www.rollingstone.com/politics/politics-features/trump-musk-protests-democracy-hands-off-indivisible-1235312482/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">protest in the millions</a> than clock in at the <a href=\"https://www.404media.co/a-us-made-iphone-is-pure-fantasy/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone screwing factory</a> or be priced out of expensive luxuries such as <a href=\"https://www.hollywoodreporter.com/business/business-news/imax-u-s-film-ban-china-1236185843/?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">movies</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/645240/nintendo-switch-2-canada-preorders-delayed-trump-tariffs?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Nintendo</a>. Elon Musk should feel this personally, after he got <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/news/645131/elon-musk-path-of-exile-2-livestream?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">cyberbullied off his video game stream</a>. If you're the richest and most powerful man in the world, can you complain to the mods?</p><p>Also, Ryan was on Crooked Media’s <b><i>Offline with Jon Favreau</i></b> this week!!! You can find that episode wherever you listen to podcasts, but <b><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/offline-with-jon-favreau/id1610392666?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">you can also just click right here</a></b>.</p><p>Anyways, here’s some fun stuff…</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DILVUFju4D3/?img_index=1&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">An interesting hairdo</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/cricketpilledd/status/1910056727392948503?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Fake ass XingXing fans</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDOY0e8Ncx8&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Here’s a 42-hour-long YouTube essay on the </a><i><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tDOY0e8Ncx8&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Beverly Hillbillies</a></i></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://mcmansionhell.com/post/780192494114816000/simulacra-for-bootlickers?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">A truly evil McMansion</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/K_A_N_D_E_L/status/1910692561695760393?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">You can puppeteer your Chomp Boy now</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tumblr.com/fragranticareviewers/779807102684299264?source=share&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Selected Gary The Snail perfume reviews</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/baseball/comments/1jpatzv/highlight_yankees_announcer_michael_kay_trying_to/?rdt=49879&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Yankees announcer Michael Kay trying to explain the plot of </a><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/baseball/comments/1jpatzv/highlight_yankees_announcer_michael_kay_trying_to/?rdt=49879&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\"><i>One Piece</i></a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DFRkWd0x0ck/?igsh=MXVlOHBpc2I1ZjVrbA%3D%3D&amp;utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Was ska band RX Bandits responsible for Jack Antonoff’s career and thus, also, Taylor Swift’s?</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/thearmorswars/status/1909633738969169985?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">If there’s a screen, there’s always a way</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://x.com/beetlemoses/status/1910002782934872081?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">Check this out</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@mystacheofbooks/video/7472578115387018527?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\" target=\"_blank\">POV: You’re shelving in the manga department and the anime couple with matching tails are standing where the next book goes</a></p></li></ul><div><hr /><div><h2> Subscribe to Premium to read the rest. </h2><p> Become a paying subscriber of Premium to get access to this post and other subscriber-only content. </p><p><a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/upgrade?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;utm_medium=newsletter&amp;utm_campaign=the-doge-principle\">Upgrade</a> Translation missing: en.app.shared.conjuction.or <a href=\"https://www.garbageday.email/login?utm_source=www.garbageday.email&amp;